{"seq":4,"slug":"intelligent-automation","title":"智能自动化与机器人","docCount":3,"url":"/education/university/engineering/automation/intelligent-automation","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"industrial-robots","title":"大学自动化 — 工业机器人与运动控制","url":"/education/university/engineering/automation/intelligent-automation/industrial-robots","wordCount":1725,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"machine-vision","title":"大学自动化 — 机器视觉与图像处理","url":"/education/university/engineering/automation/intelligent-automation/machine-vision","wordCount":1769,"readingTime":8},{"seq":3,"slug":"ai-and-smart-manufacturing","title":"大学自动化 — 人工智能与智能制造","url":"/education/university/engineering/automation/intelligent-automation/ai-and-smart-manufacturing","wordCount":1865,"readingTime":8}],"introMarkdown":"# 智能自动化与机器人\n\n当传统自动化遇上人工智能、机器视觉和柔性机械，自动化就从\"重复固定动作\"进化为\"感知环境、自主决策\"。这是当下最热门、也最能体现自动化未来方向的领域。\n\n本章聚焦工业机器人的结构与运动控制、让机器\"看懂\"世界的机器视觉，以及自动化与 AI 深度融合所催生的智能工厂、自主系统等新范式，带你眺望这门古老学科的崭新前沿。\n"}